            <div type="edition" xml:lang="gez" xml:id="div2LIT7718HomilyGab">
                <note>The following incipit is taken from 
                    <bibl corresp="http://zotero.org/groups/358366/items/36J4KMXD"><seg type="book"><!-- attributes from original bibl--></seg><ptr target="bm:Makweriya1976DersanaGabriel"/><title level="m">ድርሳነ፡ ገብርኤል። ከግዕዝ ወደአማርኛ፡ ተተርጓምና ተዘጋጅቶ (Dǝrsāna Gabrǝʾel, kagǝʿǝz wadaʾamārǝññā tatargʷǝmǝnnā tazagāǧǧǝto, ’Homiliary of Gabriel, translated from Gǝʿǝz to Amharic’)</title><author><name>Makʷǝriyā ʾAbyehoy</name></author><pubPlace>Addis Ababa</pubPlace><date>1976</date><note type="accessed">2026-01-14</note><note type="url">https://betamasaheft.eu/manuscripts/EMIP01281/</note><note type="tags"><note type="tag">bm:Makweriya1976DersanaGabriel</note></note><note type="tag">bm:Makweriya1976DersanaGabriel</note><citedRange unit="page">16</citedRange></bibl>.</note>
                    <ab>ዝንቱ፡ ድርሳን፡ ዘይትነበብ፡ አመ፡ ፲ወ፱፡ ለወርኃ፡ ታኅሣሥ፡ በበዓሉ፡ ለቅዱስ፡ ገብርኤል፡ ሰባኬ፡ ፀሐየ፡ ጽድቅ፡ ወፀዋሬ፡ ዜና፡ ብሥራት፡ ጥዑም፡ ለእለ፡ ይትዌከፍዎ፡ 
                        በልቡና፡ ንጹሕ፡ ለብሥራቱ፡ ሰባኬ፡ ሕይወት፡ ወመድኃኒት፡ ለእለ፡ ሐሙ፡ በሕምዘ፡ አስሕቶቱ፡ ለሰይጣን፡ ወእለ፡ ሞቱ፡ በሞተ፡ ኃጢአት፡ ወበዓሊወ፡ ትእዛዙ፡ ለእግዚኣብሔር፡ 
                        ፈጣሪ፡ ገብርኤል፡ ውእቱ፡ ዘሰበከ፡ ወከሠተ፡ ብርሃነ፡ ለእለ፡ ይነብሩ፡ ውስተ፡ ጽልመት፡ ወጽላሎተ፡ ሞት፡ ገብርኤል፡ ውእቱ፡ ፈጻሜ፡ ትንቢቶሙ፡ ለነቢያት፡ ዘተነበዩ፡ ቅዱሳን፡ 
                        ሰብእ፡ እምትካት፡ ተፈኒዎሙ፡ እምኀበ፡ እግዚአብሔር፤ ዘነበቡ፡ በበፆታሆሙ፡ ዘከመ፡ ከሠተ፡ ሎሙ፡ ወአንበቦሙ፡ መንፈስ፡ በእንተ፡ መድኃኒተ፡ ዓለም፡ ዘይወጽእ፡ እምጽዮን፡
                        ወየአትት፡ ኃጢአተ፡ እምያዕቆብ፡ <gap reason="ellipsis"/></ab>
            </div>
            <div type="edition" xml:id="div3LIT7718HomilyGab">
                <note>The following incipit and explicit are taken from <ref type="mss" corresp="https://betamasaheft.eu/BAVet82">Vatican City, Biblioteca Apostolica Vaticana, Aeth. 82</ref>, quoted according to
                    the catalogue description in <bibl corresp="http://zotero.org/groups/358366/items/QZH8VYBF"><seg type="book"><!-- attributes from original bibl--></seg><ptr target="bm:GrebTiss1935Codices"/><title level="m">Bybliothecae apostolicae Vaticanae codices manu scripti recensiti iussu Pii XI Pontificis maximi. Codices Aethiopici Vaticani et Borgiani, Barberinianus orientalis 2, Rossianus 865&lt;hi rend="italics"&gt;, I:&lt;/hi&gt; Enarratio codicum</title><author><forename>Sylvain</forename><surname>Grébaut</surname></author><author><forename>Eugène</forename><surname>Tisserant</surname></author><pubPlace>Città del Vaticano</pubPlace><publisher>In Bybliotheca Vaticana</publisher><date>1935</date><note type="tags"><note type="tag">Cataloguing</note><note type="tag">Ethiopic</note><note type="tag">bm:GrebTiss1935Codices</note></note><note type="tag">Cataloguing</note><note type="tag">Ethiopic</note><note type="tag">bm:GrebTiss1935Codices</note><citedRange unit="page">309</citedRange></bibl>.</note>
                <div type="textpart" subtype="title" xml:lang="gez">
                    <ab> 
                        በስመ፡ አብ፡ <gap reason="omitted" extent="unknown" resp="bm:GrebTiss1935Codices"/> ድርሳን፡ ዘቅዱስ፨ ወብፁዕ፡ ወክቡር፡ ሊቀ፡ መላእክት፡ 
                        ገብርኤል፡ ፍሡሐ፡ ገጽ፡ እምእለ፡ ይተግሁ፡ መላእክት፡ ቅዱሳን፨ አብሳሬ፡ ፍሥሐ፡ ወሐሤት፡ ለኵሉ፡ ዓለም፡ ሰባኬ፡ ፀሐየ፡ ጽድቅ፡ ወፀዋሬ፡ ዜና፡ ብስራት፤
                    </ab>
                </div>
                <div type="textpart" subtype="explicit" xml:lang="gez">
                    <ab>
                        ወኢይትኃፈር፡ እምኔሁ፡ አመ፡ ይመጽእ፡ በዕበየ፡ ግርማሁ፡ ወከመ፡ ያብአኒ፡ በኂሩተ፡ ዚአሁ፡ ውስተ፡ ሰማያት፨ ጽርሑ፡ በስእለቱ፡ ለገብርኤል፤ ለፍቁሩ፤ ወልደ፡ አምላክ፡ ለዓለመ፤ ዓለም፤ አሜን፨
                    </ab>
                </div>
